    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n64213" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λύσιος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῡ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			</span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λύσις</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>releasing, delivering</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λύσιοι θεοί</span> the gods <i>who deliver
				from curse</i> or <i>sin</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				366a
			</span></i>; esp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Λύσιος</span>, as epith. of
			Dionysus, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.613c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Corn.
				<u>ND</u>
				30
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Orph.
				<u>H.</u>
				50.2
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				9.16.6
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λύσιοι τελεταί</span>, of
			Dionysus <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Λύσιος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i> s. h. v.; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Λύσειος</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Orph.
				<u>H.</u>
				42.4
			</span></i>; voc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Λυσεῦ</span>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				52.2
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κισσεῦ</span> Lobeck).</div>
